{
  "vector": "CB2-STORE-KEY-CONSUMER-NEUTRALITY-1",
  "description": "SPL-2 oracle: the closed store-key grammar names no consumer. The gateway runtime state rides the ordinary x/<id>/** connector namespace at x/gateway/state.json (already accepted by the pre-SPL-2 grammar); the legacy nominative keys gateway/state.json and gateway/keys.json are removed from the grammar. Removal only — this vector introduces no new grammar form.",
